WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Luke 8

00:30.000 --> 00:37.100
And when a great crowd was gathering and people from town after town came to him, he said in a

00:37.100 --> 00:44.500
parable, A sower went out to sow his seed. And as he sowed, some fell along the path and was

00:44.500 --> 00:50.900
trampled underfoot, and the birds of the air devoured it. And some fell on the rock, and as

00:50.900 --> 00:57.500
it grew up, it withered away, because it had no moisture. And some fell among thorns, and the

00:57.500 --> 00:59.940
thorns grew up with it and choked it.

01:00.620 --> 01:05.560
And some fell into good soil, and grew and yielded a hundredfold.

01:06.240 --> 01:13.020
As he said these things, he called out, He who has ears to hear, let him hear.

01:13.840 --> 01:18.280
And when his disciples asked him what this parable meant, he said,

01:18.920 --> 01:24.660
To you it has been given to know the secrets of the kingdom of God. But for others they are in

01:24.660 --> 01:29.680
parables, so that seeing they may not see, and hearing they may not understand.

01:30.820 --> 01:37.620
Now the parable is this. The seed is the word of God. The ones along the path are those who have

01:37.620 --> 01:43.140
heard. Then the devil comes and takes away the word from their hearts, so that they may not

01:43.140 --> 01:49.760
believe and be saved. And the ones on the rock are those who, when they hear the word, receive it

01:49.760 --> 01:56.440
with joy. But these have no root. They believe for a while, and in time of testing fall away.

01:57.620 --> 01:59.620
And as for what fell among the thorns,

02:00.000 --> 02:05.520
they are those who hear, but as they go on their way they are choked by the cares and riches and

02:05.520 --> 02:12.200
pleasures of life, and their fruit does not mature. As for that in the good soil, they are those who,

02:12.200 --> 02:18.460
hearing the word, hold it fast in an honest and good heart, and bear fruit with patience.

02:19.360 --> 02:25.780
No one after lighting a lamp covers it with a jar, or puts it under a bed, but puts it on a stand,

02:26.100 --> 02:29.980
so that those who enter may see the light. For nothing is hidden,

02:30.000 --> 02:35.420
that will not be made manifest, nor is anything secret, that will not be known and come to light.

02:36.120 --> 02:43.120
Take care, then, how you hear. For to the one who has, more will be given. And from the one who has

02:43.120 --> 02:49.600
not, even what he thinks that he has, will be taken away. Then his mother and his brothers

02:49.600 --> 02:54.260
came to him, but they could not reach him because of the crowd. And he was told,

02:54.620 --> 02:58.500
Your mother and your brothers are standing outside, desiring to see you.

02:59.200 --> 02:59.980
But he answered,

03:00.000 --> 03:05.780
My mother and my brothers are those who hear the word of God, and do it.

03:07.580 --> 03:11.440
One day he got into a boat with his disciples, and he said to them,

03:11.980 --> 03:15.140
Let us go across, to the other side of the lake.

03:15.900 --> 03:22.000
So they set out, and as they sailed he fell asleep. And a windstorm came down on the lake,

03:22.220 --> 03:26.980
and they were filling with water and were in danger. And they went and woke him, saying,

03:27.780 --> 03:29.980
Master, Master, we are perishing.

03:30.000 --> 03:37.440
And he awoke, and rebuked the wind and the raging waves. And they ceased, and there was a calm.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.280
He said to them,

03:40.000 --> 03:41.620
Where is your faith?

03:42.200 --> 03:45.920
And they were afraid. And they marveled, saying to one another,

03:46.640 --> 03:52.640
Who then is this, that he commands even winds and water, and they obey him?

03:53.300 --> 03:57.380
Then they sailed to the country of the Gerasenes, which is opposite Galilee.

03:57.780 --> 03:59.980
When Jesus had stepped out on land,

04:00.000 --> 04:02.980
there met him a man from the city who had demons.

04:03.720 --> 04:09.620
For a long time he had worn no clothes, and he had not lived in a house but among the tombs.

04:10.320 --> 04:15.660
When he saw Jesus, he cried out and fell down before him and said with a loud voice,

04:16.480 --> 04:21.900
I want him you to do with me, Jesus, Son of the Most High God.

04:22.340 --> 04:25.940
I beg you, do not torment me.

04:26.540 --> 04:29.980
For he had commanded the unclean spirit to come out of the city, and he did so.

04:30.000 --> 04:33.660
For many a time it had seized him.

04:34.140 --> 04:37.780
He was kept under guard and bound with chains and shackles.

04:38.200 --> 04:41.940
But he would break the bonds and be driven by the demon into the desert.

04:42.820 --> 04:44.060
Jesus then asked him,

04:44.820 --> 04:46.060
What is your name?

04:46.760 --> 04:47.640
And he said,

04:48.480 --> 04:49.720
Legion.

04:51.300 --> 04:53.440
For many demons had entered him,

04:53.840 --> 04:57.280
and they begged him not to command them to depart into the abyss.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.880
Now a large herd of pigs was filled,

05:00.000 --> 05:01.220
feeding there on the hillside.

05:01.540 --> 05:04.000
And they begged him to let them enter these.

05:04.540 --> 05:05.880
So he gave them permission.

05:07.220 --> 05:10.400
Then the demons came out of the man and entered the pigs.

05:10.760 --> 05:14.460
And the herd rushed down the steep bank into the lake and were drowned.

05:15.500 --> 05:17.380
When the herdsmen saw what had happened,

05:17.660 --> 05:20.100
they fled and told it in the city and in the country.

05:20.980 --> 05:23.140
Then people went out to see what had happened,

05:23.440 --> 05:27.140
and they came to Jesus and found the man from whom the demons had gone,

05:27.700 --> 05:29.060
sitting at the feet of Jesus.

05:29.060 --> 05:31.060
Clothed and in his right mind,

05:31.060 --> 05:33.060
and they were afraid.

05:33.060 --> 05:37.060
And those who had seen it told them how the demon-possessed man had been healed.

05:37.060 --> 05:41.060
Then all the people of the surrounding country of the Gerasenes

05:41.060 --> 05:43.060
asked him to depart from them,

05:43.060 --> 05:45.060
for they were seized with great fear.

05:45.060 --> 05:48.060
So he got into the boat and returned.

05:48.060 --> 05:53.060
The man from whom the demons had gone begged that he might be with him.

05:53.060 --> 05:55.060
But Jesus sent him away, saying,

05:55.060 --> 05:57.060
Return to your home,

05:57.060 --> 05:59.060
and declare how much you love me,

05:59.060 --> 06:01.060
and how much God has done for you.

06:01.060 --> 06:03.060
And he went away,

06:03.060 --> 06:07.060
proclaiming throughout the whole city how much Jesus had done for him.

06:07.060 --> 06:09.060
Now when Jesus returned,

06:09.060 --> 06:12.060
the crowd welcomed him, for they were all waiting for him.

06:12.060 --> 06:15.060
And there came a man named Jairus,

06:15.060 --> 06:17.060
who was a ruler of the synagogue.

06:17.060 --> 06:19.060
And falling at Jesus' feet,

06:19.060 --> 06:21.060
he implored him to come to his house,

06:21.060 --> 06:23.060
for he had an only daughter,

06:23.060 --> 06:25.060
about twelve years of age,

06:25.060 --> 06:27.060
and she was dying.

06:27.060 --> 06:28.060
As Jesus went,

06:28.060 --> 06:30.060
the people pressed around him.

06:30.060 --> 06:35.060
And there was a woman who had had a discharge of blood for twelve years,

06:35.060 --> 06:38.060
and though she had spent all her living on physicians,

06:38.060 --> 06:40.060
she could not be healed by anyone.

06:40.060 --> 06:44.060
She came up behind him and touched the fringe of his garment,

06:44.060 --> 06:47.060
and immediately her discharge of blood ceased.

06:47.060 --> 06:49.060
And Jesus said,

06:49.060 --> 06:51.060
Who was it that touched me?

06:51.060 --> 06:53.060
When all denied it,

06:53.060 --> 06:54.060
Peter said,

06:54.060 --> 06:56.060
Master,

06:56.060 --> 06:59.060
the crowds surround you and are pressing in on you.

06:59.060 --> 07:01.060
But Jesus said,

07:01.060 --> 07:03.060
Someone touched me,

07:03.060 --> 07:06.060
for I perceive that power has gone out from me.

07:06.060 --> 07:09.060
And when the woman saw that she was not hidden,

07:09.060 --> 07:11.060
she came trembling,

07:11.060 --> 07:13.060
and falling down before him,

07:13.060 --> 07:15.060
declared in the presence of all the people

07:15.060 --> 07:17.060
why she had touched him,

07:17.060 --> 07:20.060
and how she had been immediately healed.

07:20.060 --> 07:22.060
And he said to her,

07:22.060 --> 07:23.060
Daughter,

07:23.060 --> 07:25.060
your faith has made you well.

07:25.060 --> 07:26.060
Go in peace.

07:26.060 --> 07:28.060
While he was still speaking,

07:28.060 --> 07:31.060
someone from the ruler's house came and said,

07:31.060 --> 07:33.060
Your daughter is dead.

07:33.060 --> 07:36.060
Do not trouble the teacher any more.

07:36.060 --> 07:39.060
But Jesus, on hearing this, answered him,

07:39.060 --> 07:41.060
Do not fear.

07:41.060 --> 07:42.060
Only believe,

07:42.060 --> 07:44.060
and she will be well.

07:44.060 --> 07:46.060
And when he came to the house,

07:46.060 --> 07:48.060
he allowed no one to enter with him,

07:48.060 --> 07:51.060
except Peter and John and James,

07:51.060 --> 07:53.060
and the father and mother of the child.

07:53.060 --> 07:54.060
And all were weeping,

07:54.060 --> 07:56.060
and mourning for her.

07:56.060 --> 07:57.060
But he said,

07:57.060 --> 07:59.060
Do not weep,

07:59.060 --> 08:00.060
for she is not dead,

08:00.060 --> 08:02.060
but sleeping.

08:02.060 --> 08:03.060
And they laughed at him,

08:03.060 --> 08:05.060
knowing that she was dead.

08:05.060 --> 08:07.060
But taking her by the hand,

08:07.060 --> 08:08.060
he called,

08:08.060 --> 08:09.060
saying,

08:09.060 --> 08:10.060
Child,

08:10.060 --> 08:12.060
arise.

08:12.060 --> 08:14.060
And her spirit returned,

08:14.060 --> 08:16.060
and she got up at once.

08:16.060 --> 08:20.060
And he directed that something should be given her to eat.

08:20.060 --> 08:22.060
And her parents were amazed.

08:22.060 --> 08:23.060
But he charged them to eat,

08:23.060 --> 08:26.060
but he charged them to tell no one what had happened.

